Spaces with avatars (spaces-avatars)
Copyright jd-solanki

This mod is derived from the `spaces` mod, version 0.1.11, shipped with the Herdr app
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), Copyright the Herdr authors, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modified by jd-solanki. Changes from the original:

- A space whose repo has a github.com `origin` shows the owner's GitHub avatar, fetched with
  `curl` and cached in the mod's `.avatars/` folder, in place of the colored letter tile.
- After the branch and ahead/behind counts, each space shows its working tree's untracked,
  modified, deleted and unmerged file counts, read from `git status --porcelain=v2`.
- A space nobody named shows its repo's name instead of Herdr's name for it.
- It shares each space's avatar (`space.avatars`) and shown name (`space.repos`) for an
  agents list to reuse.
- JSDoc types for checking against Herdr's type files.
